{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131","id":3949866067,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc7rbixT","number":14131,"title":"Copilot: SKILL.md validator does not recognize 'allowed-tools' frontmatter attribute","user":{"login":"samueltauil","id":279246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3OTI0Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/279246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil","html_url":"https://github.com/samueltauil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samueltauil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-16T22:46:08Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T14:58:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug Description\n\nThe SKILL.md YAML frontmatter validator in VS Code Copilot reports a warning for the `allowed-tools` attribute, even though it is a valid field defined in the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io/specification#allowed-tools-field).\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Create or open a `SKILL.md` with `allowed-tools` in the YAML frontmatter.\n2. Observe the warning.\n\n## Actual Behavior\n\n> Attribute 'allowed-tools' is not supported in skill files.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n`allowed-tools` should be recognized as valid per the Agent Skills spec.\n\n## Environment\n\n- VS Code Insiders\n- GitHub Copilot extension (latest)\n- Windows 11","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3991096546","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131#issuecomment-3991096546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14131","id":3991096546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7t40zi","user":{"login":"kentanakae","id":189235,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4OTIzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189235?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kentanakae","html_url":"https://github.com/kentanakae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kentanakae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kentanaka